              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yuta 11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ nĩ na maũndũ mavũthũ naku, nũndũ wĩ na amwe vu ala makwataa momanyĩsyo ma Mbalaamu, ũla wamũmanyĩsye Mbalaki kwĩkya ũlulutĩkyo mbee wa ana ma Isilaeli, nĩ kana maye syĩndũ ila syathembewe mĩvw’anano, na kũlaalaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O ta ũu naku wĩ na andũ amwe ala makwataa momanyĩsyo ma Anikolai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alyũla ngoo ĩndĩ; ethĩwa ndũkwĩka ũu ngooka kwaku mĩtũkĩ, na ngakwatya kaũ nao na ũvyũ wa kanyw’a wakwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
